Content-Length: 331

[
  {
    "id": "urn:V1",
    "speed": {
      "type": "Property",
      "values": [
        [
          10,
          "2026-04-28T09:00:00Z"
        ],
        [
          20,
          "2026-04-28T10:00:00Z"
        ],
        [
          30,
          "2026-04-28T11:00:00Z"
        ]
      ]
    },
    "type": "Vehicle"
  }
]
the map expires in 60 minutes


--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
corTroeDrop
